    "text": "If the domain of the function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>log</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>11</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mrow><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>(</mo><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>]</mo></math>, then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>36</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#946;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;"
